<body>
<main id="page-start" class="page start-page">
<p class="brand">Blackout</p>
<h1 class="start-question">今天要想清楚什么？</h1>
<div class="goal-line">
<input id="goalInput" type="text" placeholder="比如：想清楚比赛 demo 的技术方案" maxlength="2000" autocomplete="off">
<button id="micBtn" type="button" class="mic-btn" aria-label="语音输入目标"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15a3 3 0 0 0 3-3V6a3 3 0 1 0-6 0v6a3 3 0 0 0 3 3z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0h-2a5 5 0 0 1-10 0H5z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M11 18h2v3h-2z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button>
</div>
<button id="startBtn" type="button" class="primary lights-off">关灯</button>
<button id="continueLastBtn" type="button" class="quiet-btn" hidden>继续上次</button>
<p class="quiet-line">屏幕会全黑。你说，它听。说「结束」，灯再亮。</p>
<label class="check">
<input id="openObserver" type="checkbox">
<span>录视频：同时打开星图窗口</span>
</label>
<p id="voiceWarning" class="warning" hidden>这台设备没有中文语音，AI 的声音可能听不到。建议用 Chrome 或 Edge，或安装中文语音。</p>
<p id="startErr" class="error" role="alert"></p>
<section id="recentSection" class="recent">
<div id="recentList"></div>
</section>
</main>
<div id="page-black" hidden>
<div id="dot" class="dot reconnecting"></div>
<div id="hint" class="hint">空格暂停 · 说“结束”或按 Esc 结束</div>
</div>
<main id="page-result" class="page result-page" hidden>
<h2 id="resultTitle">成果</h2>
<p id="resultGoal" class="result-goal"></p>
<div id="degradedNotice" class="warning" hidden>AI 整理没有完成，下面是对话中记录的原始内容。</div>
<div id="result"></div>
<p id="resultErr" class="error" role="alert"></p>
